    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You travel on a raft, rocked by the waves, from port to port.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a sailor, an adventurer, a traveler, a merchant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cross the sea from port to port.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find a good, you load it onto a raft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You push and organize the goods like a &quot;warehouseman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find someone who wants it, you sell it to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goods from foreign lands are rare and can fetch a high price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goods that may be useful for your trip will make your raft trip richer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make the raft bigger with the money we have accumulated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you can hire sailors to help you in a pleasant way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAFT Days will offer you a peaceful time with waves and winds in your busy days.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You travel on a raft, rocked by the waves, from port to port.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a sailor, an adventurer, a traveler, a merchant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cross the sea from port to port.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you find a good, you load it onto a raft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You push and organize the goods like a &quot;warehouseman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find someone who wants it, you sell it to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goods from foreign lands are rare and can fetch a high price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goods that may be useful for your trip will make your raft trip richer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make the raft bigger with the money we have accumulated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you can hire sailors to help you in a pleasant way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAFT Days will offer you a peaceful time with waves and winds in your busy days.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "RAFT Days is a Sokoban-like puzzle + simple trading game. You travel across the sea from port to port, loading goods and tools onto your ship. You can save money by trading, expand your raft, hire sailors to help you, and enrich your journey. The waves and winds make this game relaxing to play.",
